### Phase 5: Shop Frontend — Single Product Page

#### [NEW] `app/(public)/single-order-page/[slug]/[id]/page.tsx`
Server component with SEO metadata (same pattern as product detail page).

#### [NEW] `app/(public)/single-order-page/[slug]/[id]/SingleOrderPageClient.tsx`
Client component — the main landing page:
- Fetches product data via `/api/v1/user/product/:id/single-page-data`
- Displays:
  - Product image gallery
  - Product name, description, price
  - **Variation selector** (color → size, same UX as product detail)
  - **Bulk offer table** — grouped by currently selected variation:
    ```
    ┌──────────┬────────────────┬──────────────┐
    │ Quantity │ Price Per Unit │ You Save     │
    ├──────────┼────────────────┼──────────────┤
    │ 3+ pcs   │ ৳890 (-10%)    │ ৳330 total   │
    │ 5+ pcs   │ ৳850 (-৳50/pc) │ ৳750 total   │
    └──────────┴────────────────┴──────────────┘
    ```
  - Quantity selector
  - Live price summary (updates as quantity/variation changes)
  - "Order Now" button → navigates to checkout

#### [NEW] `app/(public)/single-order-page/[slug]/[id]/checkout/page.tsx`
Single-page checkout (separate route):
- Order summary sidebar (product, variation, qty, pricing breakdown)
- Form fields: name, email, phone, delivery zone (location_mapping), full address, payment method
- **No coupon field**
- Live cost calculation matching backend formula
- Phone/email OTP verification modals (based on permission config)
- Place order → success redirect

#### [NEW] `components/single-order/` directory
Reusable components:
- `BulkOfferTable.tsx` — variation-aware tier display
- `SingleProductSummary.tsx` — price breakdown component
- `OtpVerifyModal.tsx` — phone/email OTP modal (can reuse existing `openVerifyIdentity` pattern)

